    "text": "The greatest integer less than or equal to the sum of first&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>100</mn></math> terms of the sequence <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>9</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mn>19</mn><mn>27</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mn>65</mn><mn>81</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo></math>&nbsp;is equal to ______"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "98",
  "solution": {
